      "proposed_content": "The profile is calibrated at sharply different evidential strengths: at k=1 its full offset dependence agrees with an RH-conditional theorem, whereas at k=2 the profile match appears only after the mollifier-length parameter is formally moved outside the proved range, and the derivative constant is a further conditional consequence of that extrapolated profile.",
